":["어리니"]},{"id":"b8fb53470843c312","term":"무료","zh":"免费","audio":"/audio/b8fb53470843c312b5c3.mp3","entryId":"15324","definition":"不收费用。","pronunciation":["무료"]},{"id":"5a3b0d8b05ae781d","term":"들어가다","zh":"进，进去","audio":"/audio/5a3b0d8b05ae781d7f0f.mp3","entryId":"67877","definition":"由外往里去。","pronunciation":["드러가다"]},{"id":"dcd19f5b5caac977","term":"수","zh":"可以，可能","audio":"/audio/dcd19f5b5caac9771378.mp3","entryId":"15615","definition":"做某事的能力，或某事发生的可能性。","pronunciation":["수"]},{"id":"96fe52db2531c9e7","term":"있다","zh":"能、可以（-ㄹ/을 수 있다）","audio":"/audio/96fe52db2531c9e73e53.mp3","entryId":"68797","definition":"能、可以（-ㄹ/을 수 있다）","pronunciation":["읻따"]}],"audio":"/audio/add9f5d103e24bca0c3f.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n70455-1-9-2","ko":"죄송합니다. 저희 미술관은 모든 관람객이 유료로 입장을 합니다.","zh":"很抱歉，我们美术馆的所有参观者都需要付费入场。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"죄송합니다.","meaning":"抱歉，愧疚","explanation":"죄송하다：抱歉，愧疚；ㅂ니다：正式礼貌的陈述句末。","readings":[{"term":"죄송하다","audio":"/audio/656cf6c32585f66d3b21.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"91763","senseId":"1","lemma":"죄송하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"죄송합니다","audio":"/audio/46ce53f2332052b62c9f.mp3"}},{"text":"저희","meaning":"我们","explanation":"저희：我们。","readings":[{"term":"저희","audio":"/audio/75d5f0d25c8827a5d019.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71231","senseId":"2","lemma":"저희","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"저희","audio":"/audio/75d5f0d25c8827a5d019.mp3"}},{"text":"미술관은","meaning":"美术馆","explanation":"미술관：美术馆；은：话题或对比助词。","readings":[{"term":"미술관","audio":"/audio/03c34f236b077be22f36.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"56220","senseId":"1","lemma":"미술관","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"미술관은","audio":"/audio/0bb99187e9bfcf880e07.mp3"}},{"text":"모든","meaning":"全，所有","explanation":"모든：全，所有。","readings":[{"term":"모든","audio":"/audio/f069e2cf4e3407407846.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"70813","senseId":"1","lemma":"모든","origin":"NIKL Ko